#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding high availability and disaster recovery for Quantum Compute {#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-quantum-compute}"
msgstr "Memahami high availability dan disaster recovery untuk Quantum Compute {#understanding-high-availability-and-disaster-recovery-for-quantum-compute}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability (HA) is the ability for a service to remain operational and accessible in the presence of unexpected failures. Disaster recovery is the process of recovering the service instance to a working state. IBM Quantum Compute Service customers are not responsible for disaster recovery planning or actions.\n"
msgstr "High availability (HA) adalah kemampuan suatu layanan untuk tetap beroperasi dan dapat diakses meski terjadi kegagalan yang tidak terduga. Disaster recovery adalah proses memulihkan instans layanan ke kondisi yang berfungsi kembali. Pelanggan IBM Quantum Compute Service tidak bertanggung jawab atas perencanaan atau tindakan disaster recovery.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Compute is a regional service that fulfills the defined [Service Level Objectives (SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) with any paid plan. For more information, see the [Service Level Agreement (SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) for IBM Cloud&reg;. For more information about the available IBM Cloud regions and data centers for Quantum Compute, see [Service and infrastructure availability by location](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-services_region).\n"
msgstr "Quantum Compute adalah layanan regional yang memenuhi [Service Level Objectives (SLO)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/resiliency?topic=resiliency-slo) yang telah ditetapkan dengan paket berbayar apa pun. Untuk info lebih lanjut, lihat [Service Level Agreement (SLA)](https://www.ibm.com/support/customer/csol/terms/?id=i126-9268&lc=en) untuk IBM Cloud&reg;. Untuk info lebih lanjut tentang region dan pusat data IBM Cloud yang tersedia untuk Quantum Compute, lihat [Ketersediaan layanan dan infrastruktur berdasarkan lokasi.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-services_region)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability architecture {#high-availability-architecture}"
msgstr "Arsitektur high availability {#high-availability-architecture}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "High availability features {#high-availability-features}"
msgstr "Fitur high availability {#high-availability-features}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This service is provisioned across three zones in a multi-zone region with no single point of failure. API requests are routed through a load balancer to the HA instance nodes, each in a different zone.\n"
msgstr "Layanan ini disediakan di tiga zona dalam region multi-zona tanpa titik kegagalan tunggal. Permintaan API dirutekan melalui load balancer ke node instans HA, masing-masing di zona yang berbeda.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an HA instance node or zone fails, the service continues to run API requests through to the surviving HA instance nodes.  No noticeable degradation of service occurs during a zonal failure.\n"
msgstr "Jika node instans HA atau zona mengalami kegagalan, layanan tetap melanjutkan permintaan API ke node instans HA yang masih aktif. Tidak ada penurunan layanan yang terasa selama kegagalan zona.\n"

