msgstr "Frankfurt (eu-de)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery {#disaster-recovery}"
msgstr "Pemulihan bencana {#disaster-recovery}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery (DR) covers the steps required to restore IBM Quantum Compute Service to a working state after a regional failure or other major incident.\n"
msgstr "Pemulihan bencana (disaster recovery, DR) mencakup langkah-langkah yang diperlukan untuk memulihkan IBM Quantum Compute Service ke kondisi berfungsi setelah kegagalan regional atau insiden besar lainnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM responsibilities {#ibm-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggung jawab IBM {#ibm-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is responsible for the following disaster recovery tasks:\n"
msgstr "IBM bertanggung jawab atas tugas pemulihan bencana berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring or rebuilding the provisioning environments and resources in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Memulihkan atau membangun kembali lingkungan dan sumber daya provisioning di region yang terdampak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically recovering and restoring IBM Quantum Compute Service capabilities to normal operations following a regional or major incident.\n"
msgstr "Memulihkan kemampuan IBM Quantum Compute Service secara otomatis ke operasi normal setelah insiden regional atau insiden besar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your responsibilities {#your-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggung jawab kamu {#your-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a regional failure occurs, IBM recommends the following course of action.\n"
msgstr "Jika terjadi kegagalan regional, IBM merekomendasikan langkah-langkah berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Switch to an alternate region (recommended)**\n"
msgstr "**Beralih ke region alternatif (direkomendasikan)**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your workload allows it, provision a new IBM Quantum Compute Service [instance](/guides/instances) in the alternate region and resubmit any impacted jobs there. This is the fastest path to resuming operations.\n"
msgstr "Jika beban kerja kamu memungkinkan, buat [instance](/guides/instances) IBM Quantum Compute Service baru di region alternatif dan kirim ulang job yang terdampak ke sana. Ini adalah cara tercepat untuk melanjutkan operasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You might not be able to switch regions if, for example:\n"
msgstr "Kamu mungkin tidak dapat beralih region, misalnya jika:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Your work requires specific qubit characteristics that are only available in the affected region.\n"
msgstr "Pekerjaan kamu membutuhkan karakteristik qubit tertentu yang hanya tersedia di region yang terdampak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Regulatory or data-residency requirements prevent you from using a different region.\n"
msgstr "Persyaratan regulasi atau residensi data melarang kamu menggunakan region lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Wait for service recovery in your region**\n"
msgstr "**Tunggu pemulihan layanan di region kamu**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If switching regions is not an option, wait for IBM to recover the service in your region. IBM will communicate status and progress through the [IBM Cloud status page](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). After recovery is confirmed, resubmit any impacted jobs.\n"
msgstr "Jika beralih region bukan pilihan, tunggu hingga IBM memulihkan layanan di region kamu. IBM akan menyampaikan status dan perkembangan melalui [halaman status IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status). Setelah pemulihan dikonfirmasi, kirim ulang job yang terdampak.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional responsibilities {#additional-responsibilities}"
msgstr "Tanggung jawab tambahan {#additional-responsibilities}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a full breakdown of IBM and customer responsibilities during a disaster recovery event, see [Disaster recovery](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) in the Responsibilities topic.\n"
msgstr "Untuk rincian lengkap tanggung jawab IBM dan pelanggan selama peristiwa pemulihan bencana, lihat [Pemulihan bencana](/guides/responsibilities#disaster-recovery) pada topik Tanggung jawab.\n"
